A token detector. It goes negative on:
  * the word "arm" and its spelling relatives: arm, Arm, harm, farm (strongest, about -3.3),
    other words containing "arm" such as arms, armed, alarm, warm (about -1.8);
  * code equality and inequality operators: === (about -2.3), == (about -1.7),
    != and !== (about -1.2);
  * "drug", "drugs", "pharm..." (about -1.1).
Everything else is 0. The prediction depends only on the newest token's text.
"""

