"""Layer-0 MLP output feature 4065: a "between" detector, weaker after relational nouns.

The component writes a strong negative signal on the word "between" (any capitalisation)
and its close translations ("entre", "между", "zwischen", ...). It is silent on every
other token. Its size depends on the word before "between": after relational nouns such
as "difference", "distance", "relationship" ("the difference between", "a link between")
it is about half as strong as in spatial or other uses ("located between", "in between").

The program predicts this from the current and previous token only: no carry is needed.
"""

READS = ()

BETWEEN = {"between", "_between", "etween", "-between"}
TRANSLATIONS = {"entre", "между", "między", "zwischen", "giữa", "بين"}
RELATIONAL = {
    "difference", "differences", "distance", "relationship", "relationships", "relation",
    "association", "correlation", "link", "interaction", "interactions", "overlap",
