"""Lexical detector for supplementation: making up a lack or adding an extra.

Supplement/complement, appendix, and Chinese supplement/mend characters
produce strong negative values. Related filling, supply, correction and
attachment words are weaker. Remember only a current word fragment and the
last token, resetting at document boundaries.
