"""Recognize event word forms, not an entire topic or sentence meaning.

Event/events is the strongest signal, including code spellings. Translations
and recognizable event-word fragments also respond. Happening, activity,
news, value and point words give smaller signals. Inflectional endings of
split event words and 'of' after 'event' retain a response. Other tokens are
zero; state resets between documents.
